# Evaluation harness: the frozen Tranco source list is large (tens of MB)
# and fully re-fetchable via evaluation/fetch_tranco_list.py --list-id
# <id> (see evaluation/data/tranco_metadata.txt for the exact list ID
# used) -- not meant to live in git. sample_sites.csv/.txt (the actual
# drawn sample) stay tracked: small, human-readable, and the citable
# record of exactly which domains a given evaluation run used. Per-batch
# scan results are regenerable via run_evaluation.py against that sample.
#
# The canonical n=500 batch is the one exception: aggregate.csv, the
# manifest/run-summary, and the derived-analysis JSONs (produced by the
# committed analyze_evaluation.py / analyze_cache_efficiency.py /
# tier_fix_counterfactual.py -- not one-off scratch scripts) are tracked so
# the paper's evaluation numbers stay reproducible from what's in the repo.
# The 500 individual per-site result JSONs stay out of git (large, and
# reflect third-party sites' own response content) -- archive them
# separately if needed.
src/worker/evaluation/data/tranco_*.csv
src/worker/evaluation/results/*
!src/worker/evaluation/results/20260903T182513Z_n500_c3_10scouts_FINAL/
src/worker/evaluation/results/20260903T182513Z_n500_c3_10scouts_FINAL/rank_*.json
!src/worker/evaluation/results/20260903T182513Z_n500_c3_10scouts_FINAL/cache_efficiency.json
!src/worker/evaluation/results/20260903T182513Z_n500_c3_10scouts_FINAL/tier_fix_counterfactual.json
!src/worker/evaluation/results/20260903T182513Z_n500_c3_10scouts_FINAL/analysis_summary.json
!src/worker/evaluation/results/20260903T182513Z_n500_c3_10scouts_FINAL/analysis_summary.txt
# Superseded by the committed scripts' outputs above -- these were the
# original un-reproducible one-off outputs (no source script in the repo).
src/worker/evaluation/results/20260903T182513Z_n500_c3_10scouts_FINAL/cache_counter_n500.csv
src/worker/evaluation/results/20260903T182513Z_n500_c3_10scouts_FINAL/cache_counter_n500_summary.json
src/worker/evaluation/results/20260903T182513Z_n500_c3_10scouts_FINAL/fig1_fig6_data.json